 "notes": [
  "Posted 29 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(7)': QMC/IO (Quiet Mining Colony / Independent Operation), Bespin, CC Guest Quarters, HFTMF (Heading For The Medical Frigate), DODN&WA (Do, Or Do Not & Wise Advice), KTEOF (Keeping The Empire Out Forever) and YISYW (Your Insight Serves You Well); these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'KFC' dested Kal'Falnl C'ndros (the strategy spells out 'Kal'Falnl C'ndros deploys free, forfeit 5, pilot'); 'POLR&R' dested the combo Path Of Least Resistance & Revealed; 'CC Trooper x6' dested Cloud City Trooper.",
  "Posted 'Houjinx' dested Houjix; 'Nar Shadda Wind Chimes' Nar Shaddaa Wind Chimes; 'Lietenant Greeve' Lieutenant Greeve; 'CC Core Tunnel' Cloud City: Core Tunnel; 'Blast The Door, Kid' Blast The Door, Kid!.",
  "The line 'read the stratagy before rating please' was a comment parsed as a card and removed.",
